fixture tech07_redash_off_ledge
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 7 coyote dash; s5 Dash "Air dash: 1 per airtime": dash, dash off a ledge never eats the second press
room test/cliff
spawn 840 320
frames 40
input
  # A ground dash that carries off the cliff; the second dash is pressed as the first ends.
  0 R dash
  1..8 R
  9 U R dash
  10..39 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1
  # The first dash ends on frame 9; the second starts that frame, up-right, as the air dash.
  at 9 event.dash=1 vx=3620 vy=-3620 air_dashes=0
end
